    "lawSection": "General Services, Commissioner of",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S8121\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nto authorize the commissioner of general services to transfer and convey\ncertain unappropriated state land to the village of Freeport\n\nPURPOSE:\nThis legislation authorizes the commissioner of general\nservices to convey an abandoned state armory to the Village of Freeport\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\nSection 1. authorizes the\ncommissioner of\ngeneral services to transfer and convey State land located at 63\nBabylon Turnpike, Freeport, in the County of Nassau.\n\nSection 2. Effective date\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nAt the request of the Village of Freeport this\nlegislation would allow the Commissioner of General Services to\ntransfer the abandoned state armory to the Village of Freeport.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew Bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone to state.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n\n",
